```psd
(Layer 0) Background: Dark, swirling void with subtle nebulae.
(Layer 1) Perspective Grid: Faint grid lines indicating the interior of a massive, cavernous bank.
(Layer 2) Bank Structure: Large, imposing pillars made of a futuristic, metallic material. Arches span between pillars, leading into the depth.
(Layer 3) James: A dynamic pose of James, mid-action, maybe yelling or gesturing. Detailed rendering of his face and outfit - a tactical suit, slightly damaged.
(Layer 4) AI Adversary 1-100: 100 separate layers, each depicting a unique AI opponent. Varying designs, some humanoid, some more abstract or mechanical. Spread across the bank interior. Some are floating, some are on the ground, some are interacting with each other. Include details like glowing eyes, weapon attachments, and personalized armor/designs. Prioritize the visual hierarchy - some should be more prominent than others.
(Layer 5) Name-Plates: Hundreds of floating name-plates in different fonts and sizes. Some are glowing, some are falling, some are breaking apart, reflecting the chaos. Each should have a seemingly randomized, nonsensical, and slightly threatening name.
(Layer 6) Explosions/Effects: Strategic placement of explosions, energy blasts, and smoke plumes throughout the scene. Ensure they interact with the environment, e.g., reflecting light off the metallic pillars.
(Layer 7) Debris: A scattering of metallic shards, broken name-plates, and other debris, giving a sense of destruction.
(Layer 8) Light Source: A central, bright light source (maybe from a large energy discharge) casting dynamic shadows and highlights.
(Layer 9) Overall Lighting: Overall subtle color adjustments, to enhance the mood. Adjust the contrast and highlights.
(Layer 10) James' Expression: Close-up layer, specifically focusing on James' expression, making it a critical aspect. Enhance the emotion.
(Layer 11) Nameplate Effects: Additional effects to nameplates such as shattered fragments, text distortions, or glowing halos.
```